{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c06abd9-db0e-11ef-9bcb-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c06abcb-db0e-11ef-85c4-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"苟","people_name_jianti_auto":"苟","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8c06abcd-db0e-11ef-83dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黃帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄帝","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c06abce-db0e-11ef-9889-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"古者兵車一乘，甲士三人，步卒七十二人；五百乘，三萬七千五百人。國語曰：苟本自黃帝之子。將，卽亮翻；下同。乘，繩證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"古者兵车一乘，甲士三人，步卒七十二人；五百乘，三万七千五百人。国语曰：苟本自黄帝之子。将，即亮翻；下同。乘，绳证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c06abcc-db0e-11ef-93bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛氏","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c06abd3-db0e-11ef-8b81-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c06abd4-db0e-11ef-8094-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"詩：赳赳武夫，公侯干城。毛氏傳曰：干，扞也；音戶旦翻。鄭氏箋曰：干也，城也，皆所以禦難也。干，讀如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"诗：赳赳武夫，公侯干城。毛氏传曰：干，扞也；音户旦翻。郑氏笺曰：干也，城也，皆所以御难也。干，读如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"8c06abd2-db0e-11ef-81c9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"吏","official_note":"吏泛指低级官员或办事人员，此处指苟變曾担任地方官吏，负责征收赋税等事务，在上下文中用于说明其过去的过失。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"嘗爲吏","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"5544a14d-9c81-4649-903b-8fa56313c774"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"苟变，战国时期卫国人。","link_td_id":"Q10023406","link_td_number_id":8332822,"people_name":"苟變","people_name_jianti_auto":"苟变","people_xingming":"苟变","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c06abd9-db0e-11ef-9bcb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"苟变，战国时期卫国人。","link_td_id":"Q10023406","link_td_number_id":8332822,"people_name":"變","people_name_jianti_auto":"变","people_xingming":"苟变","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8c06abdb-db0e-11ef-a4dd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2子思言苟變於衞侯曰：「其才可將五百乘。」公曰：「吾知其可將；然變也嘗爲吏，賦於民而食人二雞子，故弗用也。」子思曰：「夫聖人之官人，猶匠之用木也，取其所長，棄其所短；故杞梓連抱而有數尺之朽，良工不棄。今君處戰國之世，選爪牙之士，而以二卵棄干城之將，此不可使聞於鄰國也。」公再拜曰：「謹受敎矣！」","content_fanyi":"子思在卫侯面前举荐苟变说：“他的才能可以统率五百乘兵车。”卫侯说：“我知道他可以担任将领；但苟变曾经做过官吏，向百姓征收赋税时竟白吃了人家两个鸡蛋，所以没有任用他。”子思说：“圣人任命人做官，就像工匠使用木料，取用它的长处，舍弃它的短处；所以杞梓树有几人合抱那么粗，即使有几尺朽烂之处，好的工匠也不会丢弃。如今您处在战国乱世，要选拔勇武的爪牙之士，却因为两个鸡蛋而抛弃能保卫国家的干城之将，这样可笑的事不能让邻国听到啊！”卫侯再三拜谢说：“恭敬地接受您的教诲。”","content_jianti_auto":"2子思言苟变于衞侯曰：「其才可将五百乘。」公曰：「吾知其可将；然变也尝为吏，赋于民而食人二鸡子，故弗用也。」子思曰：「夫圣人之官人，犹匠之用木也，取其所长，弃其所短；故杞梓连抱而有数尺之朽，良工不弃。今君处战国之世，选爪牙之士，而以二卵弃干城之将，此不可使闻于邻国也。」公再拜曰：「谨受教矣！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":82,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 安王 / 二十五年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c06abcb-db0e-11ef-85c4-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-377,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000355"},"tongjian_id":"8c06abcb-db0e-11ef-85c4-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"profile":{"alias_list":[],"biography":"苟变，战国时期卫国人。","link_td_id":"Q10023406","name":"苟变","number_id":8332822},"relationships":[{"direction":"forward","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"被推荐给卫慎公，并被其任命为将，来源文本：子思在卫国时，向卫慎公推荐苟变说：“他的才能可领五百辆战车。”……卫慎公纳谏，拜谢说：“谨受教。”","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10023406","source_person_name":"苟变","source_person_number_id":8332822,"statement_id":"S-Q10023406-P100061-Q10001219","target_person_id":"Q10001219","target_person_name":"卫慎公","target_person_number_id":360330}]},"message":"success","success":true}